[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Transport mutation follow-up

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TRANSPORT-MUTATION-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Observe launcher failure and bounded ready-task completion
STATEMENT: >>>
The one-shot process transport shall return its documented IOException when the launcher returns no process, preserving a headless redirected launch request. Draining an already completed finite set of transport tasks shall remove those tasks and finish successfully without requiring cancellation. Regression tests shall independently bound a deliberately broken completion loop so that a failed completion contract is reported as a test failure rather than an unbounded mutation-host hang.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: Simulator.Client/Client.cs internal process-start seam and existing DrainAsync; verification: TransportCancellationRaceTests null launcher and finite ready-task completion, real Stryker.NET selected Client mutations. Public constructor and production Process.Start ownership/cleanup remain unchanged.
<<<
